     "titulo": "A note from an exhibition",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "この 町 には、百年以上前 に 建てられた 駅舎 が 残っている。",
       "alumno": "In this town, a station building built more than a hundred years ago has been preserved.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "建物 を 見る と、人々 の 暮らし は 時代 と ともに 変わる ものだ と 感じる。",
       "alumno": "On seeing the building, one feels that people's daily lives change with the times.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "学芸員 は「古い 物 を すぐ 捨てる ものではない」と 話した。",
       "alumno": "The curator said: \"Old objects shouldn't be thrown away straight away.\"",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "修理 を 続けた 結果、今年 から 駅舎 の 一部 が 展示室 に なった。",
       "alumno": "After continuing the repairs, this year part of the station became an exhibition room.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "訪問者 は 当時 の 写真 を 見て、町 の 変化 を 記録する こと の 大切さ に 気づいた。",
       "alumno": "On seeing photographs from that time, visitors understood the importance of recording the town's changes.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
